# ripgrep config; effective only when RIPGREP_CONFIG_PATH points at this file.
# One argument per line; lines starting with # are comments.
#
# Search hidden files/dirs (.claude/, .agents/, .gemini/, .github/, ...).
# Without this, `rg <old-string>` silently skips them and residue checks
# (20-judgment.md section 2) come back falsely clean.
--hidden
# --hidden would also search inside .git (objects, hooks, config). Keep it out.
# Pattern has no trailing slash on purpose: in worktrees/submodules .git is a file.
--glob=!.git
